    + "    // (section 6.5). The walk is the native array iterator's, which is why it\n"
    + "    // is a door row: a Hexagon body could only map a range through the\n"
    + "    // bounds-checked bracket, a slower walk of the same elements.\n"
    + "    fun arrayToSeq as nativeToSeq(values: Array(a)) -> Seq(a)\n"
