    + "// The largest magnitude an `Int` holds exactly: 2^53 - 1.\n"
    + "let intLimit: BigInt = 9_007_199_254_740_991n\n"
    + "\n"
    + "(** The smallest number that both `left` and `right` divide with nothing left\n"
    + "    over, never negative:\\\n"
    + "    `4n.lcm(6n)` is `12n`.\\\n"
    + "    It is zero when either of them is zero. *)\n"
