    + "    fun numberFormatMessage as formatMessage(text: String, phrase: String) -> String\n"
    + "\n"
    + "(** Reads `text` as a `Float`:\\\n"
    + "    `Float.parse^(\"-2.5\")` is `-2.5`.\\\n"
